  "limitations": [
    "Offline analysis of supplied evidence; source identity and truth are not authenticated.",
    "Draft decision support only; no approval, execution, filing, posting or binding customer commitment.",
    "Regional profiles are bounded source summaries; institution and national applicability require specialist review.",
    "Retrospective labels and feature provenance are supplied, not authenticated. Blocks/reviews are simulated categories, not live decisions. Selection bias, suppressed outcomes, changing attack patterns, label error and nonrandom samples prevent causal avoided-loss claims. No statistical confidence interval or population extrapolation is supplied; mature counts and excluded counts bound interpretation. Fraud face value, observed net loss and modeled friction costs are distinct and must not be summed into net savings."
  ]
